      "description": "Playing Polluted Delta instead of Scalding Tarn means no red mana available this turn, missing the opportunity to cast Faithless Looting on turn 1. Faithless Looting is the ideal turn 1 play for this deck, fueling graveyard synergies with Emperor of Bones and Psychic Frog.",
