      "description": "Emperor of Bones can only reanimate creature cards exiled with it. Lotus Bloom is an artifact and cannot be reanimated. Fallaji Archaeologist is a creature in the opponent's graveyard that could be reanimated when Emperor adapts, providing card advantage (mill 3 + potential card selection).",
